# Spec

Read and follow [`.agent_rules/spec-development.md`](../../.agent_rules/spec-development.md).

Before planning or coding:

1. Read [`spec_development/NOW.md`](../../spec_development/NOW.md) and work only on the active feature.
2. Put new ideas in [`spec_development/Milestone Backlog.md`](../../spec_development/Milestone%20Backlog.md).
3. Do not read or create `spec/master.md` or `spec/iteration-NN-roadmap.md`.

When editing `spec_development/`, follow `AGENTS.md`. Do not mark a feature completed without human approval.
